          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For setup (podcast, bedtime story, selfies…) you have from the start until bedtime plus %@ – start earlier, get more time. We'll warn you 15 s before it ends; then come back to SleepHole.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For setup (podcast, bedtime story, selfies…) you have from the start until bedtime plus %@ – start earlier, get more time. We'll warn you 15 s before it ends; then come back to SleepHole."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na prípravu (podcast, rozprávka, selfie…) máš čas od štartu až do večierky a ešte %@ po nej – kto začne skôr, má viac času. 15 s pred koncom ťa upozorníme, potom sa vráť do SleepHole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
