    "Need the bathroom or a few minutes on your phone? Tap 🌙 Pause on the night screen: %@ outside SleepHole. The first pause of a night is free, each further one costs %lld 🪙 more. A night without any pause pays +%lld 🪙.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Need the bathroom or a few minutes on your phone? Tap 🌙 Pause on the night screen: %@ outside SleepHole. The first pause of a night is free, each further one costs %lld 🪙 more. A night without any pause pays +%lld 🪙."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Potrebuješ na WC alebo pár minút na mobile? Ťukni na nočnej obrazovke na 🌙 Pauza: %1$@ mimo SleepHole. Prvá pauza za noc je zadarmo, každá ďalšia stojí o %2$lld 🪙 viac. Noc bez pauzy dáva +%3$lld 🪙."
          }
        }
      }
    },
