    "One joker a month keeps your 🔥 streak while you are ill or away: the streak waits – it neither breaks nor grows. Protected nights build nothing and pay no coins; a good night still counts as usual.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One joker a month keeps your 🔥 streak while you are ill or away: the streak waits – it neither breaks nor grows. Protected nights build nothing and pay no coins; a good night still counts as usual."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeden žolík za mesiac ochráni tvoju 🔥 sériu, keď si chorý alebo preč: séria počká – nepreruší sa ani nenarastie. Chránené noci nič nestavajú a neplatia mince; dobrá noc sa aj tak počíta ako zvyčajne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
