          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The goal is simple: go to bed and get up at the same time every day. 💙": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The goal is simple: go to bed and get up at the same time every day. 💙"
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cieľ je jednoduchý: chodiť spať a vstávať každý deň v rovnakom čase. 💙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same time every day is the base of good sleep. You can change it later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same time every day is the base of good sleep. You can change it later in Settings."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rovnaký čas každý deň je základ dobrého spánku. Neskôr ho zmeníš v Nastaveniach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search uses Apple Maps. SleepHole never asks for your location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The search uses Apple Maps. SleepHole never asks for your location."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hľadanie ide cez Apple Mapy. SleepHole sa nikdy nepýta na tvoju polohu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sound didn't start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sound didn't start: %@"
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zvuk sa nespustil: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sound stories are made of Kenney's CC0 sounds (Impact Sounds, RPG Audio, Foley Sounds) and CC0 field recordings from Freesound.org – thank you to their authors (the full list is in the project's CREDITS-freesound.txt).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sound stories are made of Kenney's CC0 sounds (Impact Sounds, RPG Audio, Foley Sounds) and CC0 field recordings from Freesound.org – thank you to their authors (the full list is in the project's CREDITS-freesound.txt)."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zvukové príbehy sú zložené z CC0 zvukov od Kenneyho (Impact Sounds, RPG Audio, Foley Sounds) a CC0 nahrávok z Freesound.org – ďakujeme ich autorom (celý zoznam je v projekte v CREDITS-freesound.txt)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system alarm is a second backup next to the backup notifications: it rings in silent mode and during a Focus even if iOS has closed SleepHole – 30 s after your wake time, or when SleepHole's own alarm stops after 2 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system alarm is a second backup next to the backup notifications: it rings in silent mode and during a Focus even if iOS has closed SleepHole – 30 s after your wake time, or when SleepHole's own alarm stops after 2 minutes."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Systémový budík je ďalšia záloha popri záložných upozorneniach: zvoní aj v tichom režime a počas Sústredenia, aj keď iOS appku SleepHole ukončil – 30 s po budíčku, alebo keď po 2 minútach stíchne vlastný budík SleepHole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Theme"
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Téma"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then come back to SleepHole and lock your phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then come back to SleepHole and lock your phone."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Potom sa vráť do SleepHole a zamkni telefón."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These pieces are in the public domain, re-synthesised for SleepHole. “Reveille” and “Alarm!” are original.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These pieces are in the public domain, re-synthesised for SleepHole. “Reveille” and “Alarm!” are original."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tieto skladby sú voľné dielo, v SleepHole nanovo syntetizované. „Budíček“ a „Poplach“ sú vlastné skladby."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They remind you of bedtime, warn you before the building collapses and act as a backup alarm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They remind you of bedtime, warn you before the building collapses and act as a backup alarm."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pripomenú večierku, varujú pred zrútením stavby a sú záložným budíkom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirty complete nights in a row – that's a real habit!": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thirty complete nights in a row – that's a real habit!"
