    "Without notifications you won't get the “Come back” warning or the backup alarm. SleepHole's warnings are time sensitive – they arrive during a Focus (Sleep, Do Not Disturb) too. If iOS asks, keep them allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without notifications you won't get the “Come back” warning or the backup alarm. SleepHole's warnings are time sensitive – they arrive during a Focus (Sleep, Do Not Disturb) too. If iOS asks, keep them allowed."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bez upozornení nedostaneš varovanie „Vráť sa“ ani záložný budík. Upozornenia SleepHole sú časovo citlivé – prídu aj počas Sústredenia (Spánok, Nerušiť). Ak sa iOS spýta, nechaj ich povolené."
          }
        }
      }
    },
