          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preklep môžeš zadarmo opraviť do 10 minút po premenovaní."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can nap until %@. An alarm rings at the end; a complete nap earns +%lld 🪙.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can nap until %@. An alarm rings at the end; a complete nap earns +%lld 🪙."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpočívať môžeš do %1$@. Na konci zazvoní budík, za hotový odpočinok +%2$lld 🪙."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can start building at the earliest %@ before bedtime and at the latest %@ after it. Otherwise the night counts as missed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can start building at the earliest %@ before bedtime and at the latest %@ after it. Otherwise the night counts as missed."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stavbu môžeš začať najskôr %1$@ pred večierkou a najneskôr %2$@ po nej. Inak sa noc počíta ako vynechaná."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can turn the screen off, but SleepHole must stay open. If you switch to another app, you get a warning and %@ to come back – and only %@ per night in total. Longer than that and the building collapses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can turn the screen off, but SleepHole must stay open. If you switch to another app, you get a warning and %@ to come back – and only %@ per night in total. Longer than that and the building collapses."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Displej môžeš vypnúť, ale SleepHole musí zostať otvorený. Ak prepneš do inej appky, dostaneš upozornenie a %1$@ na návrat – a spolu len %2$@ za noc. Dlhšie a stavba sa zrúti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't go to sleep yet – you can build from %@ to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can't go to sleep yet – you can build from %@ to %@."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ešte nemôžeš ísť spať – stavať môžeš od %1$@ do %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't nap now (%@–%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can't nap now (%@–%@)."
